          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Motion layer / shader rig",
          "context": "Sprite layer with shader effect ./motion/robot-delivery.glsl (u_content = pencil:object). Must contain ONLY the robot sprite (home centre 168,216, half-box 32) and the cargo sprite (home centre 186,170, half-box 12); the shader cuts them from these home cells and stamps them along the route, anything else in this layer is discarded. Pause: u_playing 0 + u_frozenTime (0..18 s). u_yDown stays 0. Frozen frames 0/5/9.69/9.7/13/14.5 checked by screenshot; host-clock playback not confirmed by screenshots (they render the t=0 pose). Known source issue: cargo snaps ~28 px at t=9.7 instead of easing over 9.1..9.7.",
